"""StreamDeck Launcher v1 — ESP32 StreamDeck + OBS + applications + RU/EN.

The interface language can be toggled in the top-right corner (RU / EN) and is
saved to the configuration file. Actions are stored in the config as codes,
making the configuration language-agnostic; legacy Russian-based values ​​are
automatically recognized.

Connection: A dedicated worker thread manages the port and automatically
handles reconnections (up to 6 attempts). A "watcher" intervenes only if the
thread terminates. Connection-related events are logged to `launcher_error.log`
with the `[connect]` tag.

Addictions:  pip install customtkinter pyserial obsws-python pynput psutil pygetwindow pycaw comtypes
Assembly EXE:   pyinstaller --onefile --noconsole --collect-all customtkinter --collect-all pynput --collect-all pycaw --name StreamDeckLauncher streamdeck_launcher.py
